ory (Megara Hyblaia, Akrai, Kasmenai etc) to encompass all of eastern Sicily, reaching as far as Gela and Agrigento. The ground floor covers prehistory through to the end of the Classical period. Upstairs includes Hellenistic and Roman Syracuse and a display of material from the catacombs. A gallery displaying material from Hellenistic eastern Sicily is in preparation.",{"settlement":89,"region":89,"country":117,"address":118,"geo":119},"Italy","Viale Teocrito 66, 96100 - Siracusa",{"lat":120,"lon":121},37.07636989,15.2866213,{"_":123,"type":124},"32089","inventory",{"_":126,"mainLang":127,"languages":128},"Ancient Greek","grc",[126],{"type":130,"bibl":131},"edition",[132],{"type":133,"n":134,"author":19,"title":18,"date":20,"citedRange":135,"ptr":136,"ref":23,"inscriptionDate":137,"citation":21,"uri":22,"year":138},"bulletin","NSA","299",{"target":23},"1912","1876",{"type":140,"bibl":141},"discussion",[101],{"editor":143,"principal":146,"contributors":147,"change":151},{"_":144,"ref":145},"Jonathan Prag","#JP",{"_":144,"ref":145},[148],{"_":144,"xml:id":149,"ref":150},"JP","http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537",{"_":152,"when":153,"who":145},"Jonathan Prag created file from publication","2026-05-09",[],[156],"Notizie degli scavi di antichità, 1876-",[158],"4MCP2PVV",[160,161,162,25,34,38,163,164,165,166,164,167,168,127],"isic002135","funerary epitaph for besson",{"_":5},"syracusae","siracusa","sicilia","sicily","museo archeologico regionale paolo orsi","ancient greek",[],{"title":171,"body":172,"divs":173,"editions":198,"images":208,"handnote":209},"ISic002135. Funerary epitaph for Besson","\u003Cdiv id=\"editions\">\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: \u003Ca href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/4MCP2PVV\">https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/4MCP2PVV\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpret